---
const media='/images/home-revision-20261019/';
---
<section class="nest-facility" data-core-module="sourcing-preparation" aria-labelledby="nest-facility-title">
  <figure class="nest-facility-image">
    <picture>
      <source media="(max-width:767px)" srcset={`${media}facility-mobile-640.webp 640w, ${media}facility-mobile-960.webp 960w, ${media}facility-mobile-1448.webp 1448w`} sizes="100vw" width="1448" height="1086"/>
      <img src={media+'facility-wide-1672.webp'} srcset={`${media}facility-wide-960.webp 960w, ${media}facility-wide-1440.webp 1440w, ${media}facility-wide-1672.webp 1672w`} sizes="100vw" width="1672" height="941" alt="Illustrative factory building with two rows of passenger cars and a central driveway; AI-generated concept" loading="lazy"/>
    </picture>
    
  </figure>
  <div class="nest-facility-copy nest-container">
    <h2 id="nest-facility-title">From selection<br/>to shipment.</h2>
    <div><p>Start with the model, version and destination. We help you work through sourcing, inspection, export documents and shipping requirements before you proceed.</p><a class="nest-inline-link" href="/export-services/">Explore export services</a></div>
  </div>
</section>
